# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Loop state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Loop state lives in .claude/skill-state/<skill>/ in whatever project a skill
# runs in. Non-sensitive state (version snapshots, used-topic ledgers) is safe
# to commit — it gives you history and makes CI loops work on a fresh clone.
#
# Security-sensitive state is NOT. Triage verdicts, finding hashes, and
# submission queues describe unfixed vulnerabilities; committing them
# publishes a map of what is broken and not yet patched.
.claude/skill-state/secure-review/
.claude/skill-state/defense-analyst/
.claude/skill-state/vuln-triage/
.claude/skill-state/prompt-injection-probe/
*.local.json

# Half-imported skill — not part of the published collection yet.
# Remove this line once Media/ is finished (or delete the directory).
Media/
